hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"19261","Waki narrated to us, al-Aswad ibn Shayban narrated to us from Abu Nawfal ibn Abi Aqrab from his father who said: I asked the Prophet (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) about fasting. He said: Fast a day of the month. I said: O Messenger of Allah, I am stronger. The Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) said: Fast two days of every month. I said: O Messenger of Allah, increase me. The Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) said: Three days of every month."
